cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite this repository when using its original code or teaching materials, and
  record the exact commit used. Cite MoSPI/NSO separately for PLFS data and reports.
  The MIT licence covers original code and documentation, not MoSPI materials.
type: software
title: "PLFS Data: Learn, Merge and Replicate"
authors:
  - family-names: "imdsarfraz"
repository-code: "https://github.com/imdsarfraz/PLFS-Data"
url: "https://github.com/imdsarfraz/PLFS-Data"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Stata and Python learning examples for India's Periodic Labour Force Survey, July
  2023-June 2024. Topics include household-person matching, annual survey
  weights, employment definitions and selected annual-report table replication.
  Raw unit-level data and Stata are not distributed with this repository.
keywords:
  - PLFS
  - Stata
  - Python
  - labour economics
  - survey weights
  - teaching
  - replication